    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638880/extras/bea0c696120c2463c21302a8eadcce01.poster.avif?t=1702129068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638880/extras/bea0c696120c2463c21302a8eadcce01.webm?t=1702129068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638880/extras/bea0c696120c2463c21302a8eadcce01.mp4?t=1702129068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Play as a Super AI, in an abandoned robotics lab. Use puzzle solving &amp; platforming skills to progress through the lab. You are being monitored by another Super AI, the lab itself. Unravel the meaning of your existence, accompanied by the voice of the lab. It might be your only friend.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638880/extras/51a3b900ab2d248734fc4f8a990a5558.poster.avif?t=1702129068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638880/extras/51a3b900ab2d248734fc4f8a990a5558.webm?t=1702129068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638880/extras/51a3b900ab2d248734fc4f8a990a5558.mp4?t=1702129068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638880/extras/abb2c131f8f38c05840149af79fa22b5.poster.avif?t=1702129068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638880/extras/abb2c131f8f38c05840149af79fa22b5.webm?t=1702129068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i